1
00:00:00,267 --> 00:00:01,367
This is a bale

2
00:00:01,367 --> 00:00:02,467
of paddy straw.

3
00:00:02,467 --> 00:00:03,400
A month ago,

4
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:04,500
it was standing

5
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,067
in a field in Punjab.

6
00:00:06,067 --> 00:00:08,333
Here is where it goes next.

7
00:00:08,567 --> 00:00:10,067
After the harvest,

8
00:00:10,067 --> 00:00:12,167
a baler presses the loose

9
00:00:12,167 --> 00:00:14,067
straw into tight bales,

10
00:00:14,067 --> 00:00:15,200
so it can be

11
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,500
moved instead of burned.

12
00:00:18,533 --> 00:00:20,467
An aggregator collects bales

13
00:00:20,467 --> 00:00:21,933
from dozens of farms

14
00:00:21,933 --> 00:00:23,933
and stacks them at a depot,

15
00:00:23,933 --> 00:00:25,467
dry and covered.

16
00:00:26,067 --> 00:00:26,867
From there,

17
00:00:26,867 --> 00:00:28,167
a truck takes them

18
00:00:28,167 --> 00:00:29,467
to a pellet plant.

19
00:00:29,467 --> 00:00:31,000
The straw is shredded,

20
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:31,467
dried,

21
00:00:31,467 --> 00:00:33,033
and pressed into small,

22
00:00:33,033 --> 00:00:34,333
dense pellets.

23
00:00:35,633 --> 00:00:37,733
The pellets are tested.

24
00:00:37,733 --> 00:00:38,800
Heat value.

25
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:39,633
Moisture.

26
00:00:39,633 --> 00:00:40,067
Ash.

27
00:00:40,067 --> 00:00:41,933
Then they are loaded

28
00:00:41,933 --> 00:00:44,500
for a power plant that must

29
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:47,467
burn biomass along with coal.

30
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:48,533
One bale.

31
00:00:48,533 --> 00:00:49,867
Five businesses.

32
00:00:49,867 --> 00:00:50,467
Farmer,

33
00:00:50,467 --> 00:00:51,033
baler,

34
00:00:51,033 --> 00:00:51,933
aggregator,

35
00:00:51,933 --> 00:00:53,067
pellet maker,

36
00:00:53,067 --> 00:00:53,933
buyer.

37
00:00:54,067 --> 00:00:54,933
Every link has

38
00:00:54,933 --> 00:00:56,533
to find the next one.

39
00:00:56,667 --> 00:00:58,867
That is the chain IndiaBiomass

40
00:00:58,867 --> 00:01:01,033
is being built to connect.
